            "source_call_id": "ReadFile:0",
            "content": "     1\t# IdeaForum \u2014 Page Not Found\n     2\t\n     3\t## Brand\n     4\t\n     5\tIdeaForum is an educational conference and talks platform that brings together thought leaders, educators, and curious minds to share ideas that shape the future. The 404 error page maintains the brand's minimal, professional aesthetic while guiding lost visitors back to meaningful content.\n     6\t\n     7\tBrand colors: #EB0028 (primary red), #121212 (dark text), #FFFFFF (background white)\n     8\t\n     9\tTone: Minimal, professional, and helpful. The page should feel clean and uncluttered, with a calm, reassuring voice that acknowledges the error without alarm.\n    10\t\n    11\t## Hero Logo\n    12\t\n    13\tThe IdeaForum wordmark logo is displayed prominently at the top center of the page. The logo uses the brand's primary red color and features a stylized treatment where the missing \"E\" in the middle is represented as a dashed outline \u2014 a clever visual nod to the \"not found\" concept. The logo should be large and serve as the primary visual anchor of the page.\n    14\t\n    15\t## Error Details\n    16\t\n    17\t- **Apology message:** Sorry, we can't find that.\n    18\t- **Helpful suggestion:** Perhaps we can help you find the content you're looking for:\n    19\t- **Error code:** HTTP Error 404\n    20\t- **Next steps heading:** What's next?\n    21\t- **Navigation link 1:** Go to the homepage \u2192 links to IdeaForum homepage\n    22\t- **Navigation link 2:** Visit our Help Desk \u2192 links to IdeaForum Help Desk\n    23\t\n    24\t## Search\n    25\t\n    26\tA search input field is displayed between the error message and the error code, allowing users to search for the content they were originally seeking.\n    27\t\n    28\t- Placeholder text: \"Search IdeaForum...\"\n    29\t- The field includes a search icon button (magnifying glass) aligned to the right inside the input\n    30\t- On submission, the user is directed to search results for their query\n    31\t- Input style: bordered field with subtle rounded corners, consistent with the minimal design\n    32\t\n    33\t## Error Code\n    34\t\n    35\tDisplayed in a muted, light gray background bar below the search field:\n    36\t\n    37\t- Text: **HTTP Error 404**\n    38\t- Font: subdued, smaller weight than the main error message\n    39\t- A horizontal divider/rule appears below the error code to visually separate it from the next steps section\n    40\t\n    41\t## Next Steps\n    42\t\n    43\tA short section with the heading **\"What's next?\"** followed by two text links:\n    44\t\n    45\t1. **Go to the homepage** \u2014 navigates the user to the IdeaForum main landing page\n    46\t2. **Visit our Help Desk** \u2014 navigates the user to the IdeaForum support and help center\n    47\t\n    48\tLinks should be styled in a muted/gray tone (approximately #777777) to maintain the minimal aesthetic, with an underline or hover state for accessibility.\n    49\t\n    50\t## Cookie Consent Banner\n    51\t\n    52\tA cookie consent banner appears at the bottom of the page on first visit:\n    53\t\n    54\t- **Message:** This website utilizes technologies such as cookies to enable essential site functionality, as well as for analytics, personalization, and targeted advertising. To learn more, view the following link:\n    55\t- **Privacy link:** Privacy Policy (opens in a new window)\n    56\t- **Action button:** Manage Preferences \u2014 opens a modal or panel allowing the user to configure cookie and privacy preferences\n    57\t\n    58\t## Layout & Design Notes\n    59\t\n    60\t- **Page structure:** Single-column, vertically centered layout on a white (#FFFFFF) background\n    61\t- **Responsive:** The layout should adapt gracefully to mobile, tablet, and desktop viewports\n    62\t- **Dark mode:** Not required\n    63\t- **Typography:** Clean sans-serif typeface; primary text in near-black (#121212), secondary/supporting text in medium gray (#444444 to #696969), links in light gray (#777777)\n    64\t- **Spacing:** Generous whitespace around all elements to reinforce the minimal, uncluttered feel\n    65\t- **Visual hierarchy:** Logo \u2192 Error message \u2192 Search \u2192 Error code \u2192 Next steps, flowing top to bottom with clear separation between sections"
          },
          {
            "source_call_id": "ReadFile:1",
            "content": "     1\t{\n     2\t  \"application\": \"web-design\",\n     3\t  \"case_id\": \"case-education-event-ideaforum-404\",\n     4\t  \"language\": \"en\",\n     5\t  \"site\": {\n     6\t    \"type\": \"event\",\n     7\t    \"page_count\": 1,\n     8\t    \"audience\": \"general audience interested in educational conferences and talks\",\n     9\t    \"tone\": \"minimal, professional\",\n    10\t    \"responsive\": true,\n    11\t    \"dark_mode\": false\n    12\t  },\n    13\t  \"brief\": {\n    14\t    \"title\": \"IdeaForum \u2014 Page Not Found\",\n    15\t    \"one_liner\": \"A 404 error page for an educational conference and talks platform, guiding users back to available content.\",\n    16\t    \"goal\": \"Provide a clear, branded 404 error page that helps users navigate back to the main site or search for the content they were looking for.\"\n    17\t  },\n    18\t  \"pages\": [\n    19\t    {\n    20\t      \"page_id\": \"error-404\",\n    21\t      \"file\": \"index.html\",\n    22\t      \"sections\": [\n    23\t        \"hero-logo\",\n    24\t        \"error-message\",\n    25\t        \"search\",\n    26\t        \"error-code\",\n    27\t        \"next-steps\"\n    28\t      ],\n    29\t      \"objective\": \"Inform the user that the requested page was not found and provide helpful navigation options including search and links to the homepage and help center.\"\n    30\t    }\n    31\t  ],\n    32\t  \"navigation\": [\n    33\t    {\n    34\t      \"from\": \"error-404\",\n    35\t      \"trigger\": \"Go to the homepage link\",\n    36\t      \"to\": \"homepage\"\n    37\t    },\n    38\t    {\n    39\t      \"from\": \"error-404\",\n    40\t      \"trigger\": \"Visit our Help Desk link\",\n    41\t      \"to\": \"help-desk\"\n    42\t    }\n    43\t  ],\n    44\t  \"interactions\": [\n    45\t    {\n    46\t      \"id\": \"search-input\",\n    47\t      \"page\": \"error-404\",\n    48\t      \"trigger\": \"User types a query into the search input field and clicks the search icon\",\n    49\t      \"expected\": \"A search is initiated and the user is taken to search results for their query\",\n    50\t      \"type\": \"input\"\n    51\t    },\n    52\t    {\n    53\t      \"id\": \"cookie-preferences\",\n    54\t      \"page\": \"error-404\",\n    55\t      \"trigger\": \"User clicks Manage Preferences in the cookie consent banner\",\n    56\t      \"expected\": \"A modal or panel opens allowing the user to configure cookie and privacy preferences\",\n    57\t      \"type\": \"toggle\"\n    58\t    }\n    59\t  ],\n    60\t  \"data_display\": [\n    61\t    {\n    62\t      \"id\": \"error-details\",\n    63\t      \"page\": \"error-404\",\n    64\t      \"type\": \"list\",\n    65\t      \"source_ref\": \"## Error Details\",\n    66\t      \"expected_content\": [\n    67\t        \"Sorry, we can't find that.\",\n    68\t        \"Perhaps we can help you find the content you're looking for:\",\n    69\t        \"HTTP Error 404\",\n    70\t        \"What's next?\",\n    71\t        \"Go to the homepage\",\n    72\t        \"Visit our Help Desk\"\n    73\t      ],\n    74\t      \"description\": \"Error message content displayed on the 404 page including the apology, helpful suggestion, error code, and navigation links\"\n    75\t    }\n    76\t  ]\n    77\t}"
